subckt Hybrid_Nested_Miller_Four_Stage_Operational_Amplifier (VDD VSS Vi\+ Vi\- Vo)
CM1a (net3 Vo) capacitor c=1.3p
CM1b (Vo net2) capacitor c=1.3p
CM2a (net12 net13) capacitor c=.5p
CM2b (net12 net14) capacitor c=.5p
CM3 (net12 Vo) capacitor c=1.3p
I1 (net11 VSS) isource dc=10u
M101 (net15 net11 VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=2 w=50 nf=1 m=2
